{"title":"Gold Dagger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 31) · Monster drop: Werewolf, Thak Footman, Ogre Charger</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 25 · DEX 70 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 31 <span class=\"muted\">(844 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/gold-bar\">Gold Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - Normal, 0.0% of recorded drops (4 / 8,782 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.0%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - Normal, 0.0% of recorded drops (1 / 3,956 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.0%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - Normal, 0.2% of recorded drops (1 / 601 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0.2%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gold-dagger\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Qual